    DirectDrawCreateClipper         ; function  CE 3.0..699  corpus/learn/windows-embedded-ce-6.0/ee490869(v=winembedded.60).html
    DirectDrawEnumerate             ; function  CE 3.0..599  corpus/chm/windows-ce-5.0/wceddraw5/html/wce50lrfDirectDrawEnumerate.html
    DirectDrawEnumerateEx           ; function  CE 3.0..699  corpus/learn/windows-embedded-ce-6.0/ee490845(v=winembedded.60).html
